 ability, Sarah has the Quantium Shield and Survivor ability, Sloane has the Fighter Squadron and a Sloane Aura ability, Carl has the ultimate Plasma Strike and Rocker ability, Jinx has the ultimate Hack Wave and Autorekt ability. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/451600/extras/2600795fc171c97890b708330f99f619.avif?t=1742684326\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle through a branching 32 level campaign and 3 endless survival modes</h2><br>31 bosses (32 if you count the sun). Branching campaign with secret wormhole paths, 4 difficulties from Easy to Very Hard, 3 modes, catering from novices to veterans. Easy to pickup, hard to master.<br><br>3 Endless Survival stages including a Horizontal Flood, Vertical Flood, and a procedurally generated wave survival!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/451600/extras/b38a1b962a563540e9dfea4d3efc62b3.poster.avif?t=1742684326\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/451600/extras/b38a1b962a563540e9dfea4d3efc62b3.webm?t=1742684326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/451600/extras/b38a1b962a563540e9dfea4d3efc62b3.mp4?t=1742684326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Level Editor &amp; Campaign Editor</h2>Check out the workshop for the latest player made Campaigns and Levels, or create your own! Custom levels unlock attachments so you aren't forced grind the base game to unlock attachments (though the unlock rate is lower on custom levels). <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/451600/extras/ac10bdf3bc8f0c7d50b31cee6e93edc5.poster.avif?t=1742684326\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/451600/extras/ac10bdf3bc8f0c7d50b31cee6e93edc5.webm?t=1742684326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/451600/extras/ac10bdf3bc8f0c7d50b31cee6e93edc5.mp4?t=1742684326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Difficulty for Every Player</h2>With multiple paths, difficulties, and modes, there's a sweetspot for everyone! The branching campaign has levels of very different intensity, the game modes offer everything from casual save-as-you-go to brutal hardcore with 0 extra lives. The easy/medium/hard/very hard difficulty increases the number of enemies, their firer rate, and strength. Great for novices and experts alike!",
    "short_description": "CounterAttack: Uprising is a side scrolling space shooter (shmup). Team up or fight solo, 1 - 4 player local or up to 8 players online coop, unlock upgrades, use powerful ultimate abilities, enhance your ship the way you want, and save the Earth from annihilation.",
