    "reviews": "\u201cit\u2019s undeniably one of the deepest, most addictive and fun arcade shooters you can buy on Steam and one that no self-respecting gamer should be without.\u201d<br>Infinite Frontiers<br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s doing its own thing, and it\u2019s doing it quite well.\u201d<br>80/100 \u2013 TouchArcade<br><br>\u201cCounterAttack: Uprising is a highly enjoyable shmup for fans of the genre and with very few cons it's an easy pick-up even if you're not a fan of the genre!\u201d<br>9.5/10 \u2013 WiiWareWave<br>",
